          deckDescription: 'A 40-card Italian deck: four Italian suits with ranks 2 through 7 plus three face cards per suit (or equivalent). Primiera is a point-scoring game; each suit contributes the best card to a four-card prime; point values per suit determine the hand total; no trump; historical Italian game.',
          suitDescription: 'The four Italian suits (e.g. coins, cups, swords, batons) each have ten cards in the stripped deck. In Primiera the highest card in each suit counts toward the prime total; all four suits contribute one card to the hand value.',
